# Implement a feature

1. Read `AGENTS.md`, the architecture and conventions, and relevant specs.
2. Inspect existing behavior and module patterns before changing code.
3. Keep HTTP, business logic and persistence in their respective layers.
4. Add focused tests for new behavior and failures.
5. Run relevant tests and `fastapi-harness check`; report failures.
